docs(bench): remove internal references and add the timing workflow

What:
Rewrite the comments and README to describe only what each fixture does
technically, and add the workflow that times a build on GitHub Actions.

Why:
This repository is public. Comments previously referenced internal component
names, a release identifier, a third-party name and internal measurements,
none of which belong in a public fixture set. The fixtures themselves are
unchanged; only the prose around them is.

Notes:
- The workflow measures the build phase only, checkout to image pushed.
- Two runner sizes, because the cheaper runner is also the smaller one and a
  single size confounds price with resources.
